[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The total number of ways to choose 3 marbles from 11 is given by the combination formula \( \binom{n}{k} \), where \( n \) is the total number of items, and \( k \) is the number of items to choose.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
