[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - \(\log_2 (1) = 0\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - \(\log_2 (0^+)\) (which is the limit of \(\log_2 t\) as \(t\) approaches 0 from the right) is \(-\infty\).
