[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - The probability of rolling a 1 or a 6 on a standard die is \(\frac{2}{6} = \frac{1}{3}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - The probability of getting heads on a fair coin is \(\frac{1}{2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - Therefore, the probability of winning on a single turn is \(\frac{1}{3} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{6}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 2. **Calculate the probability of not winning on a single turn:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    - The probability of not winning on a single turn is \(1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6}\).
