[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ \binom{5}{1} = \frac{5!}{1!(5-1)!} = \frac{5!}{1!4!} = \frac{5 \times 4!}{1 \times 4!} = 5 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Therefore, there are 5 ways to distribute 4 indistinguishable balls into 2 distinguishable boxes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
