[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Given \( a = 8 \), we need to find the value of \(\left(16\sqrt[3]{a^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 1. First, substitute \( a = 8 \) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \left(16\sqrt[3]{8^2}\right)^{\frac{1}{3}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 2. Calculate \( 8^2 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    8^2 = 64
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 3. Now, find the cube root of 64:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \sqrt[3]{64} = 4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 4. Substitute this back into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \[
