[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 6. Now, find the cube root of 64:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m    \[
