[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m First, we need to evaluate the exponentiation inside the expression.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 1. Calculate \(2^3\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[2^3 = 2 \times 2 \times 2 = 8\]
