[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \frac{(n-1) \cdot n \cdot (n+1)}{n} = 24
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Simplifying the left side, we get:
