[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Therefore, the probability of winning before the fourth turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 1 - \frac{125}{216} = \frac{216 - 125}{216} = \frac{91}{216}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Thus, the probability that the game will be won before the fourth turn is \(\boxed{\frac{91}{216}}\).
