[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \frac{(n-1) + n + (n+1)}{3} = \frac{3n}{3} = n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m So, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \frac{(n-1)n(n+1)}{n} = 24
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m (n-1)(n+1) = 24
