[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ x = 5 - x \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ 2x = 5 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ x = \frac{5}{2} \]
