[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ 142857 \div 18 = 7936.4444\ldots \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The integer part of the division is 7936, so we multiply it back by 18 to find the largest multiple of 18 less than 142857:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ 7936 \times 18 = 142848 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Now, we subtract this from 142857 to find the remainder:
