[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m For \(y\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[y^2 - 10y = (y-5)^2 - 25\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m For \(z\):
