[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Finally, find the cube root of 64:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
