[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The probability of winning on a single turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ P(\text{win}) = \frac{1}{3} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{6} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The probability of not winning on a single turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ P(\text{not win}) = 1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6} \]
