[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ A = P \left(1 + \frac{r}{n}\right)^{nt} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m - \( A \) is the amount of money accumulated after n years, including interest.
