[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m Now, we need to minimize the expression $\frac{1}{x} + y$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ \frac{1}{x} + y = \frac{1}{x} + \frac{1}{5 - x}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
