[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m T(b+1) - T(b) = \frac{(b+1)(b+2) - b(b+1)}{2} = \frac{(b+1)(b+2 - b)}{2} = \frac{(b+1) \cdot 2}{2} = b+1
