[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The probability of winning a single turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ P(\text{win}) = \frac{2}{6} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{1}{6} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The probability of not winning a single turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ P(\text{not win}) = 1 - \frac{1}{6} = \frac{5}{6} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m The probability of winning before the fourth turn is the sum of the probabilities of winning on the first, second, or third turn:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ P(\text{win before 4th turn}) = P(\text{win on 1st turn}) + P(\text{not win on 1st, win on 2nd}) + P(\text{not win on 1st 2 turns, win on 3rd}) \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ = \frac{1}{6} + \frac{5}{6} \times \frac{1}{6} + \left(\frac{5}{6}\right)^2 \times \frac{1}{6} \]
