[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ = \frac{36}{216} + \frac{30}{216} + \frac{25}{216} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \[ = \frac{91}{216} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m So, the probability that the game will be won before the fourth turn is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m \(\boxed{\frac{91}{216}}\)
