[36m(TaskRunner pid=1898318)[0m 2. Therefore, \(\sqrt{\sin x}\) ranges from \(0\) to \(1\), but since \(\sin x > 0\) in the given interval, \(\sqrt{\sin x}\) ranges from \(0\) to \(1\) excluding \(0\).
